{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into Landiscape, where every moment is a fierce struggle for survival! Start off in a slow and safe area and expand into dangerous enemy infested areas who all want to take you down. The more you wish to discover and unlock, the harder it will be to survive.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras/Facephoto.jpg?t=1744920049\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Landiscape, you\u2019re not just fighting to survive\u2014you\u2019re fighting to become the ultimate ruler of the land. Engage in relentless battles against cunning adversaries and formidable enemies who will stop at nothing to challenge your supremacy. Scavenge for valuable resources, build and fortify your base, and prepare for epic showdowns that will test your strategic prowess and combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base building/Crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide range of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pleasing to watch Stylized PBR Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Largely expanding updates to come</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer and Large Servers to come</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swim, mine, explore, craft, plant, etc.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141620?t=1744920049","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/2141620?t=1744920049","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/a5c39226ce263a79872ff8e24bfe4a452ad4eb20/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744920049","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/a5c39226ce263a79872ff8e24bfe4a452ad4eb20/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744920049","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Multi-player","id":1},{"description":"PvP","id":49},{"description":"Online PvP","id":36},{"description":"Co-op","id":9},{"description":"Online Co-op","id":38},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[2,5],"notes":"Guns used in battle, players fighting other players using guns, explosives, weapons."},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Step into Landiscape, where every moment is a fierce struggle for survival! Start off in a slow and safe area and expand into dangerous enemy infested areas who all want to take you down. The more you wish to discover and unlock, the harder it will be to survive.<img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2141620/extras/Facephoto.jpg?t=1744920049\" /></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In Landiscape, you\u2019re not just fighting to survive\u2014you\u2019re fighting to become the ultimate ruler of the land. Engage in relentless battles against cunning adversaries and formidable enemies who will stop at nothing to challenge your supremacy. Scavenge for valuable resources, build and fortify your base, and prepare for epic showdowns that will test your strategic prowess and combat skills.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Base building/Crafting system</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Wide range of weapons</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Pleasing to watch Stylized PBR Graphics</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Largely expanding updates to come</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Multiplayer and Large Servers to come</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Swim, mine, explore, craft, plant, etc.</p></li></ul>","developers":["GTI"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Indie","id":"23"},{"description":"Strategy","id":"2"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image